  "project_description": "The TEVIS module integrates features from the reservation API of the product VOIS|TEVIS from Kommunix GmbH .\n\nThe main feature is to display next appointment availabilites for every location configured in your TEVIS instance. This helps user to get in the booking process without additional information about the responsibility for your special concern.\n\n Features \n This module provides a block plugin to display next appointment availabilities per location.\n\n Post-Installation \n Go to /admin/config/services/tevis to create a tevis server configuration.\n\nAfter creating a server you can place a block to configure next appointment availabilities.\n\n Additional Requirements \n This module depends on the krzn/tevis-sdk client library to make use of the API client.\n\n composer handles the download for you.\n\n Back to top",
